			"Message": "build(Mountain): Update binary/lib names and Tauri config for development build profile\n\nRename the Mountain binary and library to include the full development environment profile string (DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain) to distinguish this build variant from production builds.\n\nUpdate tauri.conf.json productName and identifier to match, and add Binary/node to externalBin for the development node path.\n\nThis configuration supports the multi-profile build pipeline for debugging different environment configurations.",
			"SHA": "0a0e22ba2ddbef0b3b89c87ac9618f621f993889"
